From: Armada <noreply@armada.local>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/dpu: allow ARGB8888 inline rotation on SM4450

Gamescope uses UBWC ARGB8888 buffers for the RG55G1 output.  Include the
format in the SM4450 inline-rotation list so the atomic plane check accepts
them.

---
 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_hw_catalog.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_hw_catalog.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_hw_catalog.c
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_hw_catalog.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_hw_catalog.c
@@ -212,6 +212,7 @@
 
 static const u32 rotation_sm4450_formats[] = {
 	DRM_FORMAT_NV12,
+	DRM_FORMAT_ARGB8888,
 	DRM_FORMAT_ABGR8888,
 	DRM_FORMAT_ABGR2101010,
 };
